    C --> D[Ollama local HTTP API]
    D --> E[Gemma 3 4B]
    E --> F[Structured JSON response]
    F --> G[Normalize and validate fields]
    G --> H[Meeting summary and key points]
    G --> I[Decisions and open questions]
    G --> J[Action items: task, owner, deadline, evidence]
    H --> K[Streamlit results and downloads]
    I --> K
    J --> K
